<h2 id="why-credential-verification-matters">Why Credential Verification Matters</h2>

<p><a href="https://www.certifyme.online/blog/How-to-Prevent-Certification-and-Credential-Frauds.html">Credential fraud</a>, which is the act of altering certificates and transcripts to secure jobs or college admissions, is a documented, ongoing problem. Recruiters and admission officers can’t take documents at face value, and traditional verification which is done via calling or emailing an institution and 
waiting for a response is slow and inconsistent.</p>

<p>Digital credentials solve the waiting problem. Verification happens directly through the institution’s verification portal, instantly, without involving the issuer at all.</p>

<p><br /></p>

